"Copy Mode" = "Copy Mode";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **copy** — the *Move or Copy?* prompt is skipped." = "When active, every drop is automatically a **copy** — the *Move or Copy?* prompt is skipped.";
"Useful when you're duplicating a lot of files between folders or panels." = "Useful when you're duplicating a lot of files between folders or panels.";
"Move Mode" = "Move Mode";
"When active, every drop is automatically a **move** — files are removed from the source." = "When active, every drop is automatically a **move** — files are removed from the source.";
"Useful when re‑organising a folder." = "Useful when re‑organising a folder.";
"Important" = "Important";
"The two toggles are **mutually exclusive** — turning one on turns the other off." = "The two toggles are **mutually exclusive** — turning one on turns the other off.";
"Both reset to off when FileFluss relaunches, so a stuck *Move Mode* can't silently destroy files across sessions." = "Both reset to off when FileFluss relaunches, so a stuck *Move Mode* can't silently destroy files across sessions.";
