"**Sync** makes the destination folder match the source folder according to the rule you choose. Use it for one‑shot replications between local and cloud, or between two cloud accounts." = "**Sync** makes the destination folder match the source folder according to the rule you choose. Use it for one‑shot replications between local and cloud, or between two cloud accounts.";
"Run a sync" = "Run a sync";
"Open one folder on the left and one on the right." = "Open one folder on the left and one on the right.";
